        "original_id": "ba01a2ae-b560-50c7-860f-bca4b40b4f8a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: WVNH, WANH\n- Places: Meredith, Lakes Region, Belknap County, Carroll County, Grafton County, Strafford County, Merrimack County\n- Topics: radio simulcasting, regional geography\n\nFacts:\n- WANH is a radio station at 91.5 FM in Meredith.\n- WVNH programming is simulcast on WANH in Meredith.\n- Meredith serves the Lakes Region through WANH's broadcast.\n- The Lakes Region in New Hampshire comprises all of Belknap County.\n- The Lakes Region in New Hampshire includes the southern portion of Carroll County.\n- The Lakes Region in New Hampshire includes the eastern portion of Grafton County.\n- The Lakes Region in New Hampshire includes the northern portions of Strafford County and Merrimack County.",
